    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95518" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμῑλίον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμίλη, ἰατρικὸν ς</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>scalpel</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.60a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				9.207
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				1.44
			</span></i>; of a <i>drug</i> producing the same effect, Paul. Aeg.<i><span class="en">
				3.23.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.17.12
			</span></i>; of an <i>eye-salve</i>, written <i>zmilion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cels.
				6.6.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shoemaker's knife</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Gall.</u>
				26
			</span></i>; <i>penknife</i>, written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμηλίον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				326
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>.</div>
